  <h1>Haskell vs Rust</h1>
  <div class="artmeta"><span>By Coldwast</span><span>Updated Sep 20, 2026</span><span>9 min read</span><span class="tag">#haskell</span><span class="tag">#rust</span></div>
  <nav class="toc" id="toc"></nav>
